    <briefdescription>
<para>Factory class for creating finite-strain material instances. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides a mechanism to register materials by their name, and to create material instances based on their properties. It allows for dynamic material creation without hardcoding specific material types. </para>
